Description: Telegram management bot for OpenWrt routers (BITS-WRT)
  Monitor and manage your OpenWrt device via Telegram: status, internet
  (Huawei HiLink), momo VPN, Tailscale, clients, schedule (Bandix), Docker,
  firewall, storage, logs, backup, reboot and network tools.
